    "title": "sEATz",
    "description": "On your next visit to a sports venue, download the sEATz app and order drink, food and merchandise to have delivered to your seat or ready for pickup at the sEATz Express Lane!\r\n\r\nUsing the sEATz app is as easy as 1, 2, 3\u2026\r\n\r\n\t1. Use your phone to place your \u201ccontact-free\u201d express pickup or deliver order for a safer ordering experience.\r\n\t2. Order with a sEATz server on a \u201ctouchless\u201d tablet.\r\n\t3. Scan your QR code at one of our sEATz Express lanes to pick up your order and get back to the action or have your order delivered by a sEATz digital hawker.\r\n\u00a0\r\nsEATz: Skip the Line. Not the Game.",
